---
title: "calc_interest (Current Finance: Triple-Kink Interest Model)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_low: util_rate lte mid_kink?
    q_check_low --> q_low_rate: weight = util_rate / mid_kink
    q_check_low --> q_check_mid: util_rate lte high_kink?
    q_low_rate --> q_low_result: rate = weight * (mid_rate - base_rate) + base_rate
    q_low_result --> [*]
    q_check_mid --> q_mid_rate: weight = (util - mid_kink) / (high_kink - mid_kink)
    q_check_mid --> q_high_rate: weight = (util - high_kink) / (1 - high_kink)
    q_mid_rate --> q_mid_result: rate = weight * (high_rate - mid_rate) + mid_rate
    q_mid_result --> [*]
    q_high_rate --> q_high_result: rate = weight * (max_rate - high_rate) + high_rate
    q_high_result --> [*]

    note right of q_check_low
        INV-001: Interest rate is piecewise linear with 3 segments
        INV-002: rate(0) = base_borrow_rate_per_sec
        INV-003: rate(mid_kink) = borrow_rate_on_mid_kink
        INV-004: rate(high_kink) = borrow_rate_on_high_kink
        INV-005: rate(1.0) = max_borrow_rate
        INV-006: Rate is continuous and monotonically increasing
    end note
